        "intro.org: इस संगठन में … उसके सदस्य",
        "not_leaving.org: इस संगठन के सदस्य … उसके बाहर",
        "published.org_listed: इस संगठन के साझा एजेंटों में … उसके सदस्य",
        "ui.hub.subscriptions.enable_private: इस संगठन पर … सिर्फ़ उस संगठन तक पहुँच"
      ],
      "impact": "Stylistic consistency only: ordinary Hindi permits proximal noun phrases followed by anaphoric उसके, and every referent remains clear. No semantic, permission or runtime defect. Flagged against the brief’s stricter demonstrative discipline, not as a grammar error.",
      "suggested_fix": "If folded into an already-required remediation, use उस संगठन; it is the same oblique shape and works before में, के and पर in all seven frames. Otherwise defer in-thread; do not create another code round for this MINOR."
